---

## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| `No module named solver_selection_handoff` | `pip install -e .` from `handoff/` |
| `No module named qss_integrator` | Install `qss-integrator` into the same env |
| `No module named SundialsPy` | Install `SundialsPy` into the same env |
| Network size mismatch | Align `policy.network` + observation flags with training |
| Mechanism not found | Use `mechanism: ndodecane` (packaged) or an absolute YAML path |

---

## What is *not* included

Training (PPO loops, reward, environment), HPC sweep scripts, WandB, and
multi-policy ablation utilities remain in the research repository. This package
is **evaluation-only** by design.
